    "note": "E1 decides the 180-degree sign on AREA moments with a 1e-9 tolerance; the R2 wrapper of rotation_methods decides on contour-ring moments with 1e-3. The two tolerances are not interchangeable and are listed next to the measured residues so neither convention can be called 'the' canonicalisation."
  },
